## Figure 4 — TFUS Parameter Sweep (plasticity effect recorded at post-stim time at 5 min)

**a.** : run 
- Replace equation with explicit amplitude values  
- (Only case where TFUS amplitude is manually changed)  

Default:
- Duration = 80 s  
- PRF = 5 Hz  
- Duty cycle = 10%  



**b.**
- PRF fixed at 5 Hz  
- Duty cycle fixed at 10%  

**c.**
- Duration fixed at 80 s  
- Duty cycle fixed at 10%  

**d.**
- Duration fixed at 80 s  
- PRF fixed at 5 Hz  

**e.**
- PRF fixed at 5 Hz  
- Duration adjusted based on duty cycle  

Constraint:

Total TFUS-ON time = duty cycle × duration = constant (10% × 80 s)

